'''Buchu''' is a [[Farming]] plant grown in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] at level 39 Farming. Buchu is grown by planting a [[buchu seed]] in a [[Chambers of Xeric]] [[herb patch]]. A [[seed dibber]] is needed to plant the seed.
After 30 seconds, the planted seed will become [[Buchu]]. 

Planting the Buchu seeds gives 6 farming experience.

Each Buchu, when picked, gives 15 farming experience. The Buchu do not grow back after they are picked. The Buchu may be picked after the plant is completely grown.
